one-game-store-simulator", "summary": "GameZone is a first-person store management simulation game playable solo or in online co-op for up to four players.\n\nPlayers operate a game shop by ordering stock, arranging products, setting prices, scanning purchases, serving customers, and fulfilling online orders. Revenue and reputation can be used to expand the business and unlock new products and abilities.\n\nThe store, furniture and player characters can be customised, while physics-driven object handling is used for everyday shop tasks.", "themes": [{"id": 28, "name": "Business"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/gamezone-game-store-simulator", "videos": [{"id": 193201, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "hHjdsYAIZuA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hHjdsYAIZuA", "title": "GameZone Trailer - Extended Version", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hHjdsYAIZuA/sddefault.jpg"}]}